t. Check for a non-empty `final.txt` and no \"Operation not permitted\" in `agent.err`. If Codex needs something under the real home, the fix is to allow that one path.\n- `check_answer.py` falls back to the event stream only for kimi lanes, so an empty `final.txt` in this lane grades as \"none\". I left the grader alone.\n\nI didn't commit anything. Three `/tmp/chome-*` folders from earlier today are still there; I left them alone.","ttft_ms":2433,"type":"result","duration_ms":97229,"uuid":"8d1c46a1-a5a2-4401-a4eb-b904357182ab","ttft_stream_ms":2390,"time_to_request_ms":342,"first_content_frame_ms":2390,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0,"model_usage_since_last_result":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":22,"outputTokens":18432,"cacheReadInputTokens":407979,"cacheCreationInputTokens":34378,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.02017359,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":9766,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":34378,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"credential_expires_at":"2026-11-28T22:27:53.640Z"}
